    <body stage="SubtitleEdit">
        <part updateMethod="0" lastModifyTime="0">
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="1" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:00:02,100</start-time>
                <end-time>00:00:08,175</end-time>
                <translation>被称为战后最伟大思想家的吉本隆明
戦後最大の思想家と言われる吉本隆明</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="2" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:00:08,175</start-time>
                <end-time>00:00:11,244</end-time>
                <translation>其代表作《共同幻想论》</translation>
                <original>その代表作共同幻想論は</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="3" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:00:11,244</start-time>
                <end-time>00:00:14,975</end-time>
                <translation>重新追问“国家”为何 直至其起源</translation>
                <original>国家とは何かを起源にまで遡って問い直し</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="4" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:00:14,975</start-time>
                <end-time>00:00:17,165</end-time>
                <translation>给社会带来了冲击</translation>
                <original>社会に衝撃を与えました</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="5" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:00:19,815</start-time>
                <end-time>00:00:25,660</end-time>
                <translation>出版时间是时代浪潮涌动的1968年末</translation>
                <original>出版されたのは時代が大きなうねりを見せた1968年末</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="6" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:00:28,400</start-time>
                <end-time>00:00:30,964</end-time>
                <translation>从根本上怀疑权力
権力を根底から疑い</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="7" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:00:30,964</start-time>
                <end-time>00:00:36,175</end-time>
                <translation>试图用自己的语言和思想立身吉本的身影</translation>
                <original>自らの言葉と思想で立とうとする吉本の姿は</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="8" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:00:36,175</start-time>
                <end-time>00:00:39,200</end-time>
                <translation>获得了年轻人的热烈支持</translation>
                <original>若者たちから熱烈な支持を得ました</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="9" hasRuby="0">
                <marks>
                    <mark top="">默认标记</mark>
                </marks>
                <start-time>00:00:41,225</start-time>
                <end-time>00:00:44,375</end-time>
                <translation>国家是共同的幻想
国家は共同の幻想である</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="10" hasRuby="0">
                <marks>
                    <mark top="">默认标记</mark>
                </marks>
                <start-time>00:00:44,375</start-time>
                <end-time>00:00:50,325</end-time>
                <translation>风俗、宗教和法律也都是共同的幻想
風俗や宗教や法もまた共同の幻想である</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="11" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:00:50,625</start-time>
                <end-time>00:00:53,987</end-time>
                <translation>第1回将解读为什么吉本必须</translation>
                <original>第1回はなぜ国家というものと</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="12" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:00:53,987</start-time>
                <end-time>00:00:58,000</end-time>
                <translation>与国家这种东西进行搏斗</translation>
                <original>吉本は格闘しなければならなかったのかを読み解いていきます</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="13" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:01:16,960</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:22,010</end-time>
                <translation>第1回 从战火废墟中诞生的思想
第1回　焼け跡から生まれた思想</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="14" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:01:22,925</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:25,500</end-time>
                <translation>《100分de名著》 主持人安部美智子
100分で名著司会の安部みちこです</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="15" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:01:25,500</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:26,550</end-time>
                <translation>伊集院光
伊集院光です</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="16" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:01:26,619</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:28,500</end-time>
                <translation>那么 本月要读的是这本</translation>
                <original>さあ今月はこちらです</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="17" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:01:28,500</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:31,775</end-time>
                <translation>吉本隆明的《共同幻想论》</translation>
                <original>吉本隆明の共同幻想論です</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="18" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:01:31,775</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:35,540</end-time>
                <translation>吉本隆明曾被称为日本思想界的明星人物</translation>
                <original>日本思想界のスター的存在だったという吉本隆明ですが</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="19" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:01:35,540</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:37,440</end-time>
                <translation>伊集院 你知道吗？</translation>
                <original>伊集院さんはご存知でしたでしょうか</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="20" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:01:37,440</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:38,675</end-time>
                <translation>我啊</translation>
                <original>僕はですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="21" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:01:38,675</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:41,880</end-time>
                <translation>是在吉本芭娜娜出现的时候</translation>
                <original>吉本バナナさんが出てきたというか</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="22" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:01:41,880</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:43,625</end-time>
                <translation>或者说她崭露头角的时候</translation>
                <original>頭角が表してきた時に</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="23" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:01:43,625</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:47,425</end-time>
                <translation>印象中的他是作为她父亲 两人一起出现的</translation>
                <original>お父様として二人で出ているイメージです</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="24" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:01:47,425</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:50,025</end-time>
                <translation>可能主次有点颠倒了</translation>
                <original>ちょっと主従が逆になっているかもしれないですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="25" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:01:50,025</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:54,350</end-time>
                <translation>这本书出版大约是在50年前</translation>
                <original>この本が刊行されたのは今からおよそ50年前になるんですけれど</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="26" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:01:54,350</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:56,116</end-time>
                <translation>当时这本书作为思想类书籍
当時思想書としては</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="27" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:01:56,116</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:58,400</end-time>
                <translation>成为了畅销书</translation>
                <original>ベストセラーになったという本なんですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="28" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:01:58,400</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:00,987</end-time>
                <translation>不过在收获热烈支持的同时</translation>
                <original>ただ熱烈に支持された一方で</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="29" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:02:00,987</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:04,275</end-time>
                <translation>也有很多人说太难了没能读到最后</translation>
                <original>難しすぎて最後までは読めなかったという方も多いと</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="30" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:02:04,275</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:09,225</end-time>
                <translation>上次的康德也被说很难 确实相当难</translation>
                <original>前回のカントも難しいよって言われてかなり難しくて</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="31" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:02:09,225</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:11,040</end-time>
                <translation>途中还发了点智慧热</translation>
                <original>途中こう知恵熱出たりしてたんですけど</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="32" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:02:11,040</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:14,400</end-time>
                <translation>但最终正因为难</translation>
                <original>でも最終的に難しかった分だけ</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="33" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:02:14,400</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:16,850</end-time>
                <translation>通过老师们的讲解稍微懂了一些</translation>
                <original>先生方の説明でちょっと分かって</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="34" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:02:16,850</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:18,350</end-time>
                <translation>弄懂时的快感特别大</translation>
                <original>それ分かった時の快感大きかったんで</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="35" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:02:18,350</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:19,750</end-time>
                <translation>这周我也想努力</translation>
                <original>今週も頑張りたいと思います</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="36" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:02:19,750</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:22,000</end-time>
                <translation>就这样这个月也一起努力吧</translation>
                <original>こんな感じで今月も頑張りましょう</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="37" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:02:22,000</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:23,620</end-time>
                <translation>那么有请指导老师</translation>
                <original>では先生ご紹介しましょう</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="38" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:02:23,620</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:26,975</end-time>
                <translation>专攻日本思想史的先崎彰容老师
日本思想史がご専門の先崎彰容さんです</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="39" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:02:26,975</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:29,075</end-time>
                <translation>-请多关照 -请多关照</translation>
                <original>-お願いします　-よろしくお願いいたします</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="40" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:02:29,075</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:30,350</end-time>
                <translation>请多关照</translation>
                <original>お願いします</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="41" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:02:31,025</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:36,125</end-time>
                <translation>研究日本思想史的先崎彰容老师
日本思想史を研究する先崎彰容さん</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="42" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:02:36,125</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:40,025</end-time>
                <translation>他认为在价值观动摇、社会分裂的当下
価値観が揺らぎ社会が分断する今こそ</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="43" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:02:40,025</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:43,660</end-time>
                <translation>正是重读吉本的思想的时候</translation>
                <original>吉本の思想が読み直されるべきだと考えています</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="44" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:02:45,310</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:49,475</end-time>
                <translation>单单《共同幻想论》这个标题就给人一种很难的印象</translation>
                <original>共同幻想論というタイトルだけでも難しそうな印象があるんですが</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="45" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:02:49,475</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:52,625</end-time>
                <translation>这本书是1968年的畅销书呢</translation>
                <original>これが1968年にはベストセラーだったんですよね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="46" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:02:52,625</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:53,825</end-time>
                <translation>是的</translation>
                <original>そうですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="47" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:02:53,825</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:58,525</end-time>
                <translation>特别是 据说当时有许多大学生都读了</translation>
                <original>とりわけですね学生たちから圧倒的に読まれたというふうに言われています</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="48" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:02:58,525</start-time>
                <end-time>00:03:03,050</end-time>
                <translation>可以说是一部震撼了那个时代的名著</translation>
                <original>時代を震撼させたですね名著であると言ってもいいでしょう</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="49" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:03:03,050</start-time>
                <end-time>00:03:08,425</end-time>
                <translation>这次为了在第1讲能牢牢掌握这本书的内容</translation>
                <original>今回はですねこの本の内容をまずは1回目にしっかり掴むために</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="50" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:03:08,425</start-time>
                <end-time>00:03:13,500</end-time>
                <translation>我想通过彻底精读序文来进行</translation>
                <original>特に序文をですね徹底的に読み込むことで見ていきたいなというふうに思っています</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="51" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:03:13,500</start-time>
                <end-time>00:03:16,550</end-time>
                <translation>如果一开始就在这里掉队 接下来一个月会很辛苦</translation>
                <original>まずここで振り落とされたら一月辛いですから</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="52" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:03:16,550</start-time>
                <end-time>00:03:18,060</end-time>
                <translation>-好的 没问题 -我来了</translation>
                <original>-はい大丈夫です　-頑張ります</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="53" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:03:18,060</start-time>
                <end-time>00:03:20,850</end-time>
                <translation>我们先从基本信息看起吧</translation>
                <original>基本情報から見ていきましょう</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="54" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:03:20,850</start-time>
                <end-time>00:03:22,750</end-time>
                <translation>嗯 请看这边</translation>
                <original>はいこちらです</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="55" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:03:22,750</start-time>
                <end-time>00:03:25,350</end-time>
                <translation>《共同幻想论》的作者是</translation>
                <original>共同幻想論の作者は</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="56" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:03:25,350</start-time>
                <end-time>00:03:28,350</end-time>
                <translation>诗人兼思想家吉本隆明</translation>
                <original>詩人で思想家の吉本隆明</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="57" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:03:28,350</start-time>
                <end-time>00:03:31,375</end-time>
                <translation>1968年出版</translation>
                <original>1968年に刊行されました</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="58" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:03:31,375</start-time>
                <end-time>00:03:34,800</end-time>
                <translation>这本书从自身的战争体验出发
この本は自身の戦争体験から</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="59" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:03:34,800</start-time>
                <end-time>00:03:39,800</end-time>
                <translation>这是一篇试图彻底阐明“国家是什么”这一问题的论考</translation>
                <original>国家とは何かという問題を徹底的に解き明かそうとした論考です</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="60" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:03:39,800</start-time>
                <end-time>00:03:43,890</end-time>
                <translation>力主通过阅读《古事记》和《远野物语》</translation>
                <original>とりわけ古事記と遠野物語を読み込むことで</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="61" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:03:43,890</start-time>
                <end-time>00:03:48,550</end-time>
                <translation>逼近国家的起源与本质</translation>
                <original>国家の起源と本質に迫ろうとしたということなんですが</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="62" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:03:48,550</start-time>
                <end-time>00:03:51,564</end-time>
                <translation>简单来说 就是一本思考“国家是什么”的书</translation>
                <original>要するに国家とは何かを考えた本</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="63" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:03:51,564</start-time>
                <end-time>00:03:52,800</end-time>
                <translation>可以这样理解吗</translation>
                <original>でいいんでしょうか</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="64" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:03:52,800</start-time>
                <end-time>00:03:56,250</end-time>
                <translation>是的 关于国家的书</translation>
                <original>そうですね国家について書かれた本というのは</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="65" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:03:56,250</start-time>
                <end-time>00:03:59,739</end-time>
                <translation>无论东西方都有很多</translation>
                <original>それこそ東西を問わずたくさんあるわけですけれども</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="66" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:03:59,739</start-time>
                <end-time>00:04:02,375</end-time>
                <translation>首先这本书的特点可以说在于</translation>
                <original>まずこの本の特徴として言えるのはですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="67" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:04:02,375</start-time>
                <end-time>00:04:05,144</end-time>
                <translation>当人们建立起人际关系时</translation>
                <original>人が人間関係を作っていくと</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="68" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:04:05,144</start-time>
                <end-time>00:04:09,150</end-time>
                <translation>必然会产生各种问题和扭曲</translation>
                <original>必ずですね様々な問題歪みが起きてくるんですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="69" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:04:09,150</start-time>
                <end-time>00:04:12,619</end-time>
                <translation>将国家视作最大的人际关系</translation>
                <original>その中でも最も大きな人間関係としての</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="70" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:04:12,619</start-time>
                <end-time>00:04:15,125</end-time>
                <translation>试着进行思考</translation>
                <original>国家について考えてみようと</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="71" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:04:15,125</start-time>
                <end-time>00:04:18,157</end-time>
                <translation>试着审视终极的人际关系
究極の人間関係を見てみようと</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="72" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:04:18,157</start-time>
                <end-time>00:04:20,350</end-time>
                <translation>就是这样一本书</translation>
                <original>そういう本なんですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="73" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:04:20,350</start-time>
                <end-time>00:04:22,195</end-time>
                <translation>另外 在阅读这本书时</translation>
                <original>それからこの本を読むにあたって</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="74" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:04:22,195</start-time>
                <end-time>00:04:23,840</end-time>
                <translation>还有一个要点是</translation>
                <original>もう一つポイントなのが</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="75" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:04:23,840</start-time>
                <end-time>00:04:28,775</end-time>
                <translation>吉本不使用外国思想或哲学</translation>
                <original>吉本はですね外国思想や哲学といったものを用いないですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="76" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:04:28,775</start-time>
                <end-time>00:04:32,238</end-time>
                <translation>而是用自己的语言和日本古典
自前の言葉そして日本の古典を使って</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="77" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:04:32,238</start-time>
                <end-time>00:04:35,925</end-time>
                <translation>编织出自己的思想</translation>
                <original>自分の思想を紡ぎ出していったというところなんですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="78" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:04:35,925</start-time>
                <end-time>00:04:37,080</end-time>
                <translation>日本人在战后</translation>
                <original>戦後はですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="79" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:04:37,080</start-time>
                <end-time>00:04:40,825</end-time>
                <translation>尤其受到马克思主义国家论等学说的巨大影响</translation>
                <original>特にマルクス主義の国家論とかの影響も大きかったんですけれども</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="80" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:04:40,825</start-time>
                <end-time>00:04:44,851</end-time>
                <translation>但吉本隆明通过追溯《古事记》和《远野物语》等
吉本隆明は古事記や遠野物語といったですね</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="81" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:04:44,851</start-time>
                <end-time>00:04:47,850</end-time>
                <translation>古老的故事</translation>
                <original>古い話に遡ることによって</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="82" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:04:47,850</start-time>
                <end-time>00:04:51,450</end-time>
                <translation>对“日本这个国家是如何形成的”这一问题</translation>
                <original>この日本という国がどうやってできたんだろうかということをですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="83" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:04:51,450</start-time>
                <end-time>00:04:55,200</end-time>
                <translation>试图从根本上进行思考</translation>
                <original>徹底的に遡って根本から考えようとしたと</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="84" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:04:55,200</start-time>
                <end-time>00:04:57,575</end-time>
                <translation>《古事记》和《远野物语》
あの古事記も遠野物語も</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="85" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:04:57,575</start-time>
                <end-time>00:04:59,500</end-time>
                <translation>都曾在这个节目中介绍过</translation>
                <original>一度この番組で取り上げたことがあって</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="86" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:04:59,500</start-time>
                <end-time>00:05:02,775</end-time>
                <translation>其中我特别喜欢《远野物语》</translation>
                <original>その中でも特に遠野物語がすごくハマって</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="87" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:05:02,775</start-time>
                <end-time>00:05:07,050</end-time>
                <translation>甚至划线精读 非常认真地读完了</translation>
                <original>もう線引いて読むぐらい一生懸命読んだんですけど</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="88" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:05:07,050</start-time>
                <end-time>00:05:09,580</end-time>
                <translation>但我没能把它和“国家是什么”联系起来</translation>
                <original>国家とはには繋がらなくて</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="89" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:05:09,580</start-time>
                <end-time>00:05:12,545</end-time>
                <translation>不过 的确会给人感觉那是真正古老的日本</translation>
                <original>まあでもなんか本当に昔の日本</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="90" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:05:12,545</start-time>
                <end-time>00:05:14,925</end-time>
                <translation>这种联系之类的东西</translation>
                <original>ってこういう感じの結びつきみたいのは</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="91" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:05:14,925</start-time>
                <end-time>00:05:17,083</end-time>
                <translation>模模糊糊地进来了</translation>
                <original>なんとなく漠然と入ってきたんで</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="92" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:05:17,083</start-time>
                <end-time>00:05:19,000</end-time>
                <translation>就只靠那个去摸索</translation>
                <original>そこだけ頼りに行こうっていう</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="93" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:05:19,000</start-time>
                <end-time>00:05:22,450</end-time>
                <translation>老师认为现在读这本书有什么意义呢</translation>
                <original>この今この本を読むというのはどういうふうにお考えですか</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="94" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:05:22,450</start-time>
                <end-time>00:05:27,225</end-time>
                <translation>就是我们也面临着与战争体验相似的情况</translation>
                <original>要するに戦争体験と似たような状況があるわけですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="95" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:05:27,225</start-time>
                <end-time>00:05:30,025</end-time>
                <translation>对他来说是在战前 对我们来说是在新冠之前</translation>
                <original>戦前まであるいはコロナの前まで</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="96" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:05:30,025</start-time>
                <end-time>00:05:34,075</end-time>
                <translation>我们都有着一套理所当然的生活方式</translation>
                <original>私たちが当然だと思っていた生活の様式であるとか</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="97" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:05:34,075</start-time>
                <end-time>00:05:38,025</end-time>
                <translation>以及价值观之类的东西 它们彻底的崩塌了一次</translation>
                <original>それから価値観みたいなものが一度完全に壊れるわけですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="98" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:05:38,025</start-time>
                <end-time>00:05:44,325</end-time>
                <translation>那么 在那些粉碎殆尽价值观和秩序归零的地方</translation>
                <original>じゃあその一旦粉々に砕けたですね価値観や秩序がゼロ地点になったところから</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="99" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:05:44,325</start-time>
                <end-time>00:05:48,825</end-time>
                <translation>重新认真思考国家究竟是什么</translation>
                <original>じゃあもう一回国家って何なんだろうということを真剣に考えたというところが</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="100" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:05:48,825</start-time>
                <end-time>00:05:52,625</end-time>
                <translation>我认为这正是今天值得读的一个理由</translation>
                <original>今日読むに値する一つの理由かなというふうに思っています</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="101" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:05:52,625</start-time>
                <end-time>00:05:54,650</end-time>
                <translation>-真让人感兴趣啊　-确实</translation>
                <original>-すごい興味惹かれますね　-ちょっとね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="102" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:05:54,650</start-time>
                <end-time>00:05:56,450</end-time>
                <translation>那么让我们进入正文吧</translation>
                <original>さあでは中身に入っていきましょう</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="103" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:05:56,450</start-time>
                <end-time>00:05:58,900</end-time>
                <translation>朗读由演员江本明担任
朗読は俳優の江本明さんです</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="104" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:06:01,200</start-time>
                <end-time>00:06:03,625</end-time>
                <translation>围绕《日美安保条约》
日米安保条約をめぐって</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="105" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:06:03,625</start-time>
                <end-time>00:06:08,220</end-time>
                <translation>市民和学生们与国家正面对峙的60年安保斗争
市民や学生たちが国家と対峙した60年安保闘争</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="106" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:06:12,435</start-time>
                <end-time>00:06:15,800</end-time>
                <translation>吉本此时与他们一起</translation>
                <original>吉本はこの時彼らと共に</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="107" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:06:15,800</start-time>
                <end-time>00:06:18,545</end-time>
                <translation>选择同权力斗争到底
権力と全面的に戦いました</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="108" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:06:21,745</start-time>
                <end-time>00:06:26,025</end-time>
                <translation>此后 吉本从源头重新思考国家是什么</translation>
                <original>その後吉本は国家とは何かをその始まりから試作し</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="109" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:06:26,025</start-time>
                <end-time>00:06:30,410</end-time>
                <translation>于1968年发表了《共同幻想论》
1968年に共同幻想論を発表</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="110" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:06:32,610</start-time>
                <end-time>00:06:38,350</end-time>
                <translation>在其中 吉本认为国家不是看得见的政府或机构</translation>
                <original>そこで吉本は国家とは目に見える政府や機関ではなく</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="111" hasRuby="0">
                <marks>
                    <mark top="">默认标记</mark>
                </marks>
                <start-time>00:06:38,350</start-time>
                <end-time>00:06:41,900</end-time>
                <translation>而是人们共同抱有的幻想</translation>
                <original>人々が共同に抱く幻想であると考えました</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="112" hasRuby="0">
                <marks>
                    <mark top="">默认标记</mark>
                </marks>
                <start-time>00:06:45,325</start-time>
                <end-time>00:06:48,625</end-time>
                <translation>国家是共同的幻想
国家は共同の幻想である</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="113" hasRuby="0">
                <marks>
                    <mark top="">默认标记</mark>
                </marks>
                <start-time>00:06:48,625</start-time>
                <end-time>00:06:54,750</end-time>
                <translation>风俗、宗教和法律也都是共同的幻想
風俗や宗教や法もまた共同の幻想である</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="114" hasRuby="0">
                <marks>
                    <mark top="">默认标记</mark>
                </marks>
                <start-time>00:06:54,750</start-time>
                <end-time>00:06:57,340</end-time>
                <translation>以更加难以名状的形式</translation>
                <original>もっと名付けようもない形で</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="115" hasRuby="0">
                <marks>
                    <mark top="">默认标记</mark>
                </marks>
                <start-time>00:06:57,340</start-time>
                <end-time>00:07:02,075</end-time>
                <translation>将习惯、民族和土著信仰交织在一起
習慣や民族や土俗的信仰が絡んで</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="116" hasRuby="0">
                <marks>
                    <mark top="">默认标记</mark>
                </marks>
                <start-time>00:07:02,075</start-time>
                <end-time>00:07:09,300</end-time>
                <translation>经过漫长岁月形成的精神感性也是共同的幻想
長い年月に作り上げた精神の感性も共同の幻想である</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="117" hasRuby="0">
                <marks>
                    <mark top="">默认标记</mark>
                </marks>
                <start-time>00:07:09,300</start-time>
                <end-time>00:07:13,775</end-time>
                <translation>人类创造了共同的机制和系统</translation>
                <original>人間が共同の仕組みやシステムを作って</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="118" hasRuby="0">
                <marks>
                    <mark top="">默认标记</mark>
                </marks>
                <start-time>00:07:13,775</start-time>
                <end-time>00:07:16,625</end-time>
                <translation>它们被守护、被传播</translation>
                <original>それが守られたり流布されたり</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="119" hasRuby="0">
                <marks>
                    <mark top="">默认标记</mark>
                </marks>
                <start-time>00:07:16,625</start-time>
                <end-time>00:07:19,450</end-time>
                <translation>在成为惯例的地方</translation>
                <original>慣行となったりしているところでは</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="120" hasRuby="0">
                <marks>
                    <mark top="">默认标记</mark>
                </marks>
                <start-time>00:07:19,450</start-time>
                <end-time>00:07:22,940</end-time>
                <translation>到处都存在着共同幻想</translation>
                <original>どこでも共同の幻想が存在している</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="121" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:07:25,490</start-time>
                <end-time>00:07:28,350</end-time>
                <translation>国家和法律虽然看不见</translation>
                <original>国家や法律は目に見えないけれど</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="122" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:07:28,350</start-time>
                <end-time>00:07:33,550</end-time>
                <translation>但我们却默认着它们的存在 并生活着</translation>
                <original>私たちはそれを当然あるものと思い生きています</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="123" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:07:33,550</start-time>
                <end-time>00:07:38,220</end-time>
                <translation>然而吉本却用“幻想”这个词来把握它们</translation>
                <original>しかし吉本はそれらを幻想という言葉で捉えたのです</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="124" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:07:41,420</start-time>
                <end-time>00:07:46,560</end-time>
                <translation>并且运用个人幻想、对幻想、共同幻想
そして個人幻想対幻想共同幻想</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="125" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:07:46,560</start-time>
                <end-time>00:07:49,875</end-time>
                <translation>用这些独特的概念
といった独自の概念を用いて</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="126" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:07:49,875</start-time>
                <end-time>00:07:54,000</end-time>
                <translation>试图重新构建国家与个人之间的关系</translation>
                <original>国家と個人との関係を再構築しようとしました</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="127" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:07:56,825</start-time>
                <end-time>00:08:03,790</end-time>
                <translation>就这样 前所未有的全新国家论诞生了</translation>
                <original>こうしてこれまでにない全く新しい国家論が誕生したのです</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="128" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:08:06,890</start-time>
                <end-time>00:08:08,660</end-time>
                <translation>确实词语有点难</translation>
                <original>確かにちょっと言葉は難しいけど</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="129" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:08:08,660</start-time>
                <end-time>00:08:13,550</end-time>
                <translation>但我感觉其中包含着某种令人兴奋的东西</translation>
                <original>なんかゾクゾクするものが入っている感じは僕はします</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="130" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:08:13,550</start-time>
                <end-time>00:08:16,380</end-time>
                <translation>重要的关键词已经出现了三个</translation>
                <original>大事なキーワードが早速三つ出てきましたので</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="131" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:08:16,380</start-time>
                <end-time>00:08:17,525</end-time>
                <translation>让我们来看一下吧</translation>
                <original>見ていきましょう</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="132" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:08:17,525</start-time>
                <end-time>00:08:22,575</end-time>
                <translation>这是让这本书一举成名的独特关键词</translation>
                <original>これはこの本を一躍有名にした独自のキーワードなんですけれども</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="133" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:08:22,575</start-time>
                <end-time>00:08:23,880</end-time>
                <translation>个人幻想</translation>
                <original>個人幻想</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="134" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:08:23,880</start-time>
                <end-time>00:08:25,020</end-time>
                <translation>对幻想</translation>
                <original>対幻想</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="135" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:08:25,020</start-time>
                <end-time>00:08:27,250</end-time>
                <translation>共同幻想 出现了这些</translation>
                <original>共同幻想と出てきました</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="136" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:08:27,250</start-time>
                <end-time>00:08:29,700</end-time>
                <translation>首先第一个“个人幻想”</translation>
                <original>まず一つ目の個人幻想というのは</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="137" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:08:29,700</start-time>
                <end-time>00:08:31,425</end-time>
                <translation>是指一个人</translation>
                <original>一人の人間がですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="138" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:08:31,425</start-time>
                <end-time>00:08:36,360</end-time>
                <translation>会抱有疑神疑鬼、怀疑 或是憧憬、不满等想象</translation>
                <original>疑心暗鬼や疑いあるいは憧れ不平不満といったイメージを抱いてしまう</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="139" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:08:36,360</start-time>
                <end-time>00:08:39,000</end-time>
                <translation>这就是个人幻想</translation>
                <original>そういうのが個人幻想です</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="140" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:08:39,000</start-time>
                <end-time>00:08:40,860</end-time>
                <translation>所以接下来的“对幻想”</translation>
                <original>だから続いての対幻想は</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="141" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:08:40,860</start-time>
                <end-time>00:08:43,200</end-time>
                <translation>正如“对”这个词所示</translation>
                <original>対という言葉にもあります通り</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="142" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:08:43,200</start-time>
                <end-time>00:08:47,275</end-time>
                <translation>在一对一的关系中 有时会心醉神迷</translation>
                <original>1対1の関係でその中で夢見心地の時もあるし</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="143" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:08:47,275</start-time>
                <end-time>00:08:49,825</end-time>
                <translation>有共鸣 也会有激烈争吵</translation>
                <original>ひどく喧嘩をする時もあるしといったような</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="144" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:08:49,825</start-time>
                <end-time>00:08:53,725</end-time>
                <translation>指的是两个人共同抱有的幻想</translation>
                <original>ので2人で抱かれる幻想のことを指す</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="145" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:08:53,725</start-time>
                <end-time>00:08:56,940</end-time>
                <translation>然后第三个是与国家相连的幻想</translation>
                <original>そして3つ目が国家につながっていく幻想で</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="146" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:08:56,940</start-time>
                <end-time>00:08:59,075</end-time>
                <translation>从小处说 比如村落社会</translation>
                <original>小さなところでは村社会とか</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="147" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:08:59,075</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:01,300</end-time>
                <translation>或者某种集会等</translation>
                <original>あるいは何かの集まりなんかから</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="148" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:09:01,300</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:05,025</end-time>
                <translation>直到国家为止的整个集体狂热起来</translation>
                <original>国家に至るまでの集団全体が熱狂したりとか</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="149" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:09:05,025</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:08,375</end-time>
                <translation>或抱有的那种幻想 就称为共同幻想</translation>
                <original>抱くような幻想のことを共同幻想というふうに言います</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="150" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:09:08,375</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:12,675</end-time>
                <translation>吉本就是从这三个方面展开思考国家的吧</translation>
                <original>吉本はこの3つから国家について広げて考えていたわけですよね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="151" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:09:12,675</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:15,087</end-time>
                <translation>是的 最终来说</translation>
                <original>そうですね最終的にはですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="152" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:09:15,087</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:18,250</end-time>
                <translation>如果能阐明这种共同幻想的形成机制</translation>
                <original>この共同幻想の成り立ちが解明できれば</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="153" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:09:18,250</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:21,093</end-time>
                <translation>那么各种这样的关系性本身</translation>
                <original>いろんなそういった関係性そのものをですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="154" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:09:21,093</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:23,575</end-time>
                <translation>是不是就可以加以考察了</translation>
                <original>考察できるんじゃないかということで</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="155" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:09:23,575</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:26,280</end-time>
                <translation>也就是说 本书用一句话概括</translation>
                <original>つまり本書は一言で言うなら</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="156" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:09:26,280</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:28,175</end-time>
                <translation>就是对关系性的考察</translation>
                <original>関係性についての考察と</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="157" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:09:28,175</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:29,700</end-time>
                <translation>我想可以这样说</translation>
                <original>こういうことになると思います</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="158" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:09:29,750</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:31,700</end-time>
                <translation>越来越感兴趣了</translation>
                <original>興味が湧いてくるな</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="159" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:09:31,700</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:35,150</end-time>
                <translation>那么 吉本为什么会写《共同幻想论》呢</translation>
                <original>ではなぜ吉本が共同幻想論を書いたのか</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="160" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:09:35,150</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:36,840</end-time>
                <translation>让我们来看看它的原点</translation>
                <original>その原点をご覧いただきましょう</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="161" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:09:40,015</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:42,114</end-time>
                <translation>大正13年</translation>
                <original>大正13年</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="162" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:09:42,114</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:47,140</end-time>
                <translation>吉本隆明出生于东京下町的船木匠家中
吉本隆明は東京の下町で船大工の家に生まれました</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="163" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:09:50,690</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:53,980</end-time>
                <translation>昭和16年 太平洋战争爆发</translation>
                <original>昭和16年大平洋戦争開戦</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="164" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:09:55,455</start-time>
                <end-time>00:10:01,625</end-time>
                <translation>当时的吉本是一个信奉皇国思想的军国少年
当時の吉本は公国思想を信奉する軍国少年でした</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="165" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:10:01,625</start-time>
                <end-time>00:10:05,925</end-time>
                <translation>在同级生们陆续被动员上战场的过程中</translation>
                <original>同級生たちが次々と戦争に動員されていく中</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="166" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:10:05,925</start-time>
                <end-time>00:10:08,940</end-time>
                <translation>他在工业学校学习应用化学
工業学校で応用化学を学びます</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="167" hasRuby="0">
                <marks>
                    <mark top="">默认标记</mark>
                </marks>
                <start-time>00:10:12,365</start-time>
                <end-time>00:10:20,000</end-time>
                <translation>我当时抱着一种激烈的想法 认为应该把战争彻底进行到底</translation>
                <original>私は徹底的に戦争を継続すべきだという激しい考えを抱いていた</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="168" hasRuby="0">
                <marks>
                    <mark top="">默认标记</mark>
                </marks>
                <start-time>00:10:20,000</start-time>
                <end-time>00:10:22,850</end-time>
                <translation>死早已被预想在内</translation>
                <original>死はすでに勘定に入れてある</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="169" hasRuby="0">
                <marks>
                    <mark top="">默认标记</mark>
                </marks>
                <start-time>00:10:22,850</start-time>
                <end-time>00:10:25,725</end-time>
                <translation>死并不可怕</translation>
                <original>死は恐ろしくはなかった</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="170" hasRuby="0">
                <marks>
                    <mark top="">默认标记</mark>
                </marks>
                <start-time>00:10:25,725</start-time>
                <end-time>00:10:27,820</end-time>
                <translation>我甚至无法想象反战或厌战</translation>
                <original>反戦とか厭戦とかが</original>
