                <end-time>00:11:13,275</end-time>
                <translation>吉本看到了这样的景象</translation>
                <original>吉本はこんな光景を目にします</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="181" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:11:15,825</start-time>
                <end-time>00:11:18,700</end-time>
                <translation>那是背着像小山一样毛毯和食物</translation>
