            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="187" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:11:41,625</start-time>
                <end-time>00:11:44,750</end-time>
                <translation>就这样回到故乡 这是为什么？</translation>
                <original>故郷に帰っていくのはなぜだろう</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="188" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:11:44,750</start-time>
                <end-time>00:11:47,060</end-time>
                <translation>就拿我自己来说也是</translation>
                <original>そういう私にしても</original>
