            </t>
            <t id="" time="" torder="1" vertical="0" index="214" hasRuby="0">
                <start-time>00:13:42,600</start-time>
                <end-time>00:13:45,975</end-time>
                <translation>他一直怀揣着某种令人心神不宁的东西</translation>
                <original>何かざわざわしたものをずっと抱えてたんですね</original>
